WEBVTT

00:00:19.292 --> 00:00:21.250
Supreme Commander Fudo did...?

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:25.875
He left a note behind. It seems that
he left the academy early this morning.

00:00:27.208 --> 00:00:32.250
He's going to go look for...
the legendary Mythic Aquarion?

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:34.833
Did he obtain some sort of a clue?

00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:36.333
I don't know,

00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:40.708
though it could be written
in the Book of the Twin Stars.

00:00:40.708 --> 00:00:42.833
The Book of the Twin Stars...

00:00:53.625 --> 00:00:57.458
There are... so many holes!

00:00:57.458 --> 00:00:59.458
There he is! This way!

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:03.917
This is quite deep.

00:01:03.917 --> 00:01:05.958
Andy!

00:01:05.958 --> 00:01:07.333
What happened to him?

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:09.917
--Er...
--After he did such remarkable work the other day...

00:01:09.917 --> 00:01:14.542
Yeah! The hot spring Andy
dug up was just wonderful!

00:01:14.542 --> 00:01:16.625
I wonder... if something happened.

00:01:16.625 --> 00:01:18.458
Urk!

00:01:18.458 --> 00:01:20.583
Do you know something, Mix?

00:01:20.583 --> 00:01:22.792
No! N-Not really!

00:01:22.792 --> 00:01:25.792
Yeah, I wonder what happened!

00:01:28.417 --> 00:01:30.250
Oh, no...

00:01:34.833 --> 00:01:36.458
Mix...

00:01:36.458 --> 00:01:40.958
<i>Zetsubou teki ni kimi wa kirei sa</i>

00:01:40.958 --> 00:01:49.000
<i>Hanten suru sekai no platonic aishi aou</i>

00:01:55.292 --> 00:02:05.667
<i>Bokura ga miteru sekai wa</i>
<i>itsu demo sakasama de</i>

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:14.625
<i>Doushiyou mo nai koto de taigai kimatteku</i>

00:02:14.625 --> 00:02:20.250
<i>Namida suru hodo kizutsuku hitomi</i>

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:26.500
<i>Kokoro de sakebi nagara damatte ita</i>

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:38.625
<i>Saigo no futari mazare nai</i>
<i>mama byouyomi ga kikoetekuru</i>

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:43.250
<i>Zetsubou teki ni kimi wa kirei sa</i>

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:49.125
<i>Sutare yuku doubutsu mitai ni aishi aou</i>

00:02:49.125 --> 00:02:53.625
<i>Nakitai kurai kimi wa kirei sa</i>

00:02:53.625 --> 00:02:59.708
<i>Hanten suru sekai no platonic kanjitai yo</i>

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:10.375
"Rare Iguras"

00:03:10.375 --> 00:03:11.958
"Rare Iguras"
A concert?

00:03:13.375 --> 00:03:15.500
Thanks. I'll think about it.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.833
I don't want you to just think about it--
I want you to come with me.

00:03:18.833 --> 00:03:21.083
I'll be waiting for you. See ya.

00:03:24.375 --> 00:03:26.250
Asked out on a date again?

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:29.417
Your new look seems to be
a hit with the guys, Zessica!

00:03:29.417 --> 00:03:33.542
Hmm... I like it sweeter.

00:03:33.542 --> 00:03:36.583
Your bold love confession during the
battle sim could also be part of it, too.

00:03:36.583 --> 00:03:39.792
--Urk!
--It's kinda touching.

00:03:39.792 --> 00:03:44.167
I'm sorry. Did you do it
because of what I told you?

00:03:44.167 --> 00:03:47.583
Not really. I said it because I wanted to say it.

00:03:47.583 --> 00:03:50.750
At least I was able to move forward.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.250
Really?

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.917
But...

00:03:54.917 --> 00:03:58.292
...what I'm walking towards
might be a dead end.

00:04:01.292 --> 00:04:03.583
--Miss Suzushiro!
--Yes?

00:04:03.583 --> 00:04:07.125
Good timing. I was on my way
to deliver this to the dorm.

00:04:07.125 --> 00:04:08.208
Here you go.

00:04:08.208 --> 00:04:09.750
Thank you.

00:04:13.208 --> 00:04:14.750
Mikono!

00:04:16.708 --> 00:04:20.958
Oh, no... This isn't anything
that I should hide from you.

00:04:20.958 --> 00:04:22.958
I got a letter from my father.

00:04:22.958 --> 00:04:24.625
From your father?

00:04:24.625 --> 00:04:26.667
I didn't really get along with him, so...

00:04:26.667 --> 00:04:28.500
Hm?

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:31.250
I didn't think that he'd send me a letter.

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:33.375
I guess he does worry about me a bit.

00:04:33.375 --> 00:04:36.083
Of course he does. He's your father.

00:04:36.083 --> 00:04:38.458
Well, it's weird to hear that
coming from me, I guess.

00:04:38.458 --> 00:04:40.875
Not true!

00:04:40.875 --> 00:04:45.667
About my mom... I do
remember a little about her.

00:04:45.667 --> 00:04:48.750
But I don't remember anything about my father.

00:04:52.208 --> 00:04:56.000
At any rate, none of this makes sense to me.

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.333
You mean about what happened that time?

00:04:58.333 --> 00:05:02.000
Are you talking about me
defending him that time?

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.458
Don't!

00:05:03.458 --> 00:05:05.333
Don't shoot him.

00:05:05.333 --> 00:05:08.875
Please forgive him!

00:05:08.875 --> 00:05:11.958
No, it's not that I'm blaming you!

00:05:11.958 --> 00:05:15.500
Right now, we all have to
put our hearts together, so...

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.333
That's how I feel, too!

00:05:18.333 --> 00:05:22.375
My role is to connect everyone's feelings.

00:05:22.375 --> 00:05:25.125
But I really don't understand it!

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:28.000
Mikono!

00:05:45.667 --> 00:05:47.292
This is...

00:05:51.042 --> 00:05:53.958
This is rare. What's up?

00:05:53.958 --> 00:05:58.458
Dad's letter was delivered to me by mistake.

00:05:58.458 --> 00:06:01.583
I'm sorry. I carelessly opened it.

00:06:01.583 --> 00:06:04.583
The old man's handwriting is hard to read, so...

00:06:04.583 --> 00:06:08.208
In this day and age, he doesn't
even have to use snail mail.

00:06:08.208 --> 00:06:10.250
Is something wrong?

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:13.750
No. Well then, I've delivered it, so...!

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:15.375
Hey, Mikono!

00:06:21.542 --> 00:06:23.875
Stupid me.

00:06:23.875 --> 00:06:27.167
I should've stopped reading right away.

00:06:27.167 --> 00:06:31.792
I don't know what caused
Neo-DEAVA to enroll Mikono,

00:06:31.792 --> 00:06:36.917
but I've been worried that she
might have become a burden to you,

00:06:36.917 --> 00:06:41.042
as she's never been able
to do anything properly.

00:06:42.792 --> 00:06:50.625
If you wish, I can bring her back from
Neo-DEAVA and keep her at home.

00:06:50.625 --> 00:06:55.208
As usual, to dad, I'm an incapable child.

00:06:55.208 --> 00:06:56.750
Mikono?

00:07:02.125 --> 00:07:04.458
You're concerned about Andy?

00:07:04.458 --> 00:07:08.000
He's quite depressed right now, right?

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:10.375
It's my fault he's like that.

00:07:10.375 --> 00:07:13.750
But you two were very nice to each other.

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:17.625
We had a little trouble during
the field trip the other day.

00:07:17.625 --> 00:07:19.208
I'm so pathetic.

00:07:19.208 --> 00:07:21.958
I go around telling people
to say how they really feel,

00:07:21.958 --> 00:07:26.708
but when it comes to myself, I don't
have the courage to cross the line.

00:07:26.708 --> 00:07:30.708
No matter what, I see all guys
as being like my father, so...

00:07:30.708 --> 00:07:32.458
Your father...

00:07:32.458 --> 00:07:36.667
You've heard the reason why I hate guys, right?

00:07:36.667 --> 00:07:39.333
--Yeah.
--How about you, Mikono?

00:07:39.333 --> 00:07:42.125
Did you get along with your dad?

00:07:42.125 --> 00:07:44.833
Me? I was...

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:49.167
U-Um...

00:07:49.167 --> 00:07:51.000
What do you want, Mikono?

00:07:53.625 --> 00:07:55.792
You're such a wavering child!

00:07:56.792 --> 00:08:01.333
I think I was always trying
to gauge my father's feelings.

00:08:01.333 --> 00:08:03.333
Even when I wanted to tell him something,

00:08:03.333 --> 00:08:06.375
I couldn't say anything because
I was afraid of being scolded.

00:08:06.375 --> 00:08:10.417
And then, I'd get scolded for wavering.

00:08:10.417 --> 00:08:12.708
I see.

00:08:12.708 --> 00:08:15.708
Oh, well... We can't understand them, can we?

00:08:15.708 --> 00:08:18.792
Even though they're our fathers,
they're still of the opposite gender.

00:08:18.792 --> 00:08:23.292
Only guys can understand
the feelings of other guys!

00:08:28.083 --> 00:08:32.083
Oh, come to think of it...
Is Shushu a girl or a boy?

00:08:32.083 --> 00:08:33.583
That's...

00:08:43.583 --> 00:08:45.667
Zessica?

00:08:45.667 --> 00:08:48.292
Are you training at this late hour?

00:08:48.292 --> 00:08:52.750
I remembered... that I was a fighter...

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:55.917
...although it hasn't been so obvious lately.

00:08:55.917 --> 00:08:59.083
I wanted to make sure I didn't
lose that part of me, so...

00:08:59.083 --> 00:09:01.083
Well, then... Good night!

00:09:02.833 --> 00:09:04.417
Zessica...

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:16.042
What am I doing?

00:09:20.167 --> 00:09:23.250
Dead end... huh...

00:09:29.833 --> 00:09:33.833
The Iron Sea's operation
rate is now below 40%.

00:09:33.833 --> 00:09:34.792
Most of all,

00:09:34.792 --> 00:09:38.333
the energy required for dimensional
transposition is immeasurable.

00:09:38.333 --> 00:09:41.125
If we continue to go back and forth to Vega,

00:09:41.125 --> 00:09:44.458
we will have to further cut the
services we provide our citizens,

00:09:44.458 --> 00:09:46.833
and if that happens, there's a
possibility of large-scale riots.

00:09:48.458 --> 00:09:51.792
It seems like we've come
to the end of our rope.

00:09:53.292 --> 00:09:54.917
What about Kagura's whereabouts?

00:09:54.917 --> 00:09:58.625
I'm sorry. He's still missing.

00:09:58.625 --> 00:10:02.333
Mykage is probably pulling the strings.

00:10:02.333 --> 00:10:06.958
That man isn't thinking
about Altair's future at all.

00:10:06.958 --> 00:10:09.042
Er...?

00:10:10.042 --> 00:10:12.292
Get Afura Gnis ready to deploy.

00:10:12.292 --> 00:10:14.583
--What?!
--That's...

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:18.500
I'm going to Vega.

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:21.750
The time seems to have come for
me to experience the battlefield...

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:24.208
An experience I haven't had for some time.

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:36.417
Alicia...

00:10:36.417 --> 00:10:40.583
In order for this world to once
again hear the cry of a newborn,

00:10:40.583 --> 00:10:43.500
I'll be sure to find the true Eve.

00:10:44.792 --> 00:10:48.375
I might be able to see him...

00:10:48.375 --> 00:10:52.500
The son you left behind on Vega.

00:10:57.708 --> 00:10:59.375
You read it, didn't you...?

00:10:59.375 --> 00:11:02.042
--What?
--The letter from our old man.

00:11:03.208 --> 00:11:05.208
I'm sorry.

00:11:05.208 --> 00:11:08.833
I'm not upset that you read it.

00:11:08.833 --> 00:11:11.708
You appeared to be feeling down, so...

00:11:11.708 --> 00:11:16.583
Seriously, why do parents
have to worry so unnecessarily?

00:11:17.667 --> 00:11:20.958
I can... go home.

00:11:20.958 --> 00:11:22.500
What?

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:28.083
If I'm a burden to you
and the others like dad says,

00:11:28.083 --> 00:11:31.875
an incapable child like me
should stay put at home.

00:11:31.875 --> 00:11:33.375
Mikono.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:37.208
Ow...

00:11:37.208 --> 00:11:38.750
What'd you do that for?

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:42.667
Since you were a kid, you've been trying
way too hard to gauge others' feelings.

00:11:42.667 --> 00:11:44.125
Hm?

00:11:44.125 --> 00:11:47.250
Because you don't want to upset or hurt others,

00:11:47.250 --> 00:11:49.292
you're afraid of saying what you really feel.

00:11:49.292 --> 00:11:53.792
But what you're most afraid of is
you yourself getting hurt, isn't it...?

00:11:55.583 --> 00:12:01.917
I've always thought of you as an
incapable, timid little sister, too.

00:12:01.917 --> 00:12:06.500
But this guy, who I met for
the first time, said this to me...

00:12:07.792 --> 00:12:10.792
It's true that I've just met her,

00:12:10.792 --> 00:12:15.083
but I feel she's different now.

00:12:15.083 --> 00:12:20.792
I think maybe she wants to change herself!

00:12:20.792 --> 00:12:23.292
Amata said that...?

00:12:23.292 --> 00:12:26.542
I hate to admit it, but he was right.

00:12:26.542 --> 00:12:28.792
You've certainly changed...

00:12:29.875 --> 00:12:33.833
So much that I can't wait
to show you to our old man.

00:12:33.833 --> 00:12:35.500
Cayenne...

00:12:50.292 --> 00:12:53.208
I've never heard this tone before.

00:12:53.208 --> 00:12:56.542
It's a grave and noble sound.

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:04.500
The ocean... That blue
color brings back memories.

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:07.667
Vega from my youth...

00:13:07.667 --> 00:13:12.917
Izumo... Are you trying to attain success now?

00:13:12.917 --> 00:13:15.250
Or are you there to find out

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:18.250
the whereabouts of the seed
that the flower left behind?

00:13:19.333 --> 00:13:21.167
We've never seen that Abductor before.

00:13:21.167 --> 00:13:24.208
It reeks of the smell of our enemy's boss.

00:13:26.208 --> 00:13:28.458
--You're late, Andy!
--I'm sorry.

00:13:34.958 --> 00:13:36.000
Are you okay?!

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:39.833
Yeah. There's nothing wro...

00:13:39.833 --> 00:13:41.333
Urk!

00:13:44.667 --> 00:13:46.500
Hey, Andy!

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:49.292
--Hey!
--He's digging a hole here, too?!

00:13:49.292 --> 00:13:53.167
No good. He's a piece of junk right now.

00:13:53.167 --> 00:13:55.292
Five Vector machines can deploy.

00:13:55.292 --> 00:13:57.625
Two Vector machines will support Aquarion!

00:13:57.625 --> 00:13:59.875
The Elements who'll go on board are...

00:13:59.875 --> 00:14:01.542
I'll leave the decision to you.

00:14:01.542 --> 00:14:03.917
Cayenne, Amata and...

00:14:03.917 --> 00:14:06.000
I'll go!

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:08.875
No! We can't allow you girls to go!

00:14:08.875 --> 00:14:12.542
If fighting is prohibited, I can't be myself!

00:14:12.542 --> 00:14:16.167
As a fighter, I want to
overcome being a woman!

00:14:16.167 --> 00:14:18.708
I want to help everyone!

00:14:18.708 --> 00:14:20.542
You girls...

00:14:20.542 --> 00:14:22.125
Let's let them go.

00:14:22.125 --> 00:14:27.208
There's certainly a limit to the
capabilities of male Elements alone.

00:14:27.208 --> 00:14:31.458
Fudo... I'm not wrong, am I?

00:14:31.458 --> 00:14:35.000
Okay, then! For Aquarion,
Amata, Zessica and Malloy!

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:36.917
Cayenne and Mix, support Aquarion!

00:14:36.917 --> 00:14:38.417
Roger!

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:43.417
Zessica is pretty fired up.

00:14:43.417 --> 00:14:46.417
That's why I'm so worried.

00:14:46.417 --> 00:14:49.500
Somehow I can't help but
have a bad feeling about this.

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:56.958
Let's merge! I'll be the head. Okay?!

00:14:56.958 --> 00:14:57.958
Zessica...?

00:14:57.958 --> 00:14:59.000
Roger.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:03.208
Heartbreak Gattai! Go! Aquarion!

00:15:07.667 --> 00:15:11.500
I want to at least be by Amata's
side when we're fighting!

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:14.083
So these are Zessica's feelings...

00:15:14.083 --> 00:15:17.625
Gattai really is the best!

00:15:17.625 --> 00:15:20.458
Aquarion Gepart!

00:15:24.083 --> 00:15:26.583
Leave the mass-produced machines to us!

00:15:27.833 --> 00:15:30.667
Don't underestimate Vector machines!

00:15:41.375 --> 00:15:43.167
I'll finish it with one blow!

00:15:46.125 --> 00:15:49.750
You're inexperienced.
I'll acknowledge your spirit, though.

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:54.250
--Can't be!
--It didn't work at all!

00:15:56.417 --> 00:15:57.917
Take this!

00:16:05.667 --> 00:16:07.375
Damage report, stat!

00:16:07.375 --> 00:16:10.667
The surrounding area of the West
Area's gym has been destroyed!

00:16:10.667 --> 00:16:14.542
Our enemy absorbed Gepart's beam
and shot it back with twice the power.

00:16:14.542 --> 00:16:16.458
Then, how about this?!

00:16:20.458 --> 00:16:24.042
You have youth, which Altair recently lost...

00:16:24.042 --> 00:16:26.125
...but that alone isn't enough to defeat me.

00:16:29.208 --> 00:16:30.708
What?!

00:16:35.417 --> 00:16:37.625
Don't lose your cool, Zessica!

00:16:37.625 --> 00:16:39.667
Attacking with firearms carries a high risk!

00:16:39.667 --> 00:16:41.375
Turn this into to a hand-to-hand battle!

00:16:41.375 --> 00:16:43.708
You don't have to tell me!

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:48.708
Malloy! Help me with your power!

00:16:48.708 --> 00:16:50.917
Okay, Zessica!

00:16:50.917 --> 00:16:52.708
Atrophy Power...

00:16:52.708 --> 00:16:54.292
Super Twister!

00:17:05.875 --> 00:17:08.750
--How was it?!
--Malloy... Malloy...

00:17:11.333 --> 00:17:14.083
Atrophy Power... That's interesting.

00:17:14.083 --> 00:17:18.417
But young people are
the weaker ones in any age.

00:17:20.708 --> 00:17:23.583
In order to avoid a pointless fight,

00:17:23.583 --> 00:17:26.875
I'll show you the absolute
difference between our powers.

00:17:26.875 --> 00:17:29.458
This time for sure...! Super Twister!

00:17:30.667 --> 00:17:32.667
I won't take it a second time!

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:40.250
Gepart is...!

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:44.917
The Gattai was canceled?!

00:17:44.917 --> 00:17:47.375
Malloy is unconscious due
to the shock received earlier!

00:17:47.375 --> 00:17:50.250
Vector Y is currently flying on autopilot!

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:51.750
I'll go!

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:53.833
Element change with Mikono!

00:17:53.833 --> 00:17:56.167
Cayenne! Merge with Amata and Mikono!

00:17:56.167 --> 00:17:57.875
Zessica! Back up Aquarion!

00:17:57.875 --> 00:17:59.083
Why?!

00:17:59.083 --> 00:18:03.375
You lack composure!
Why are you so reckless today?

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:08.875
Amata! Cayenne! Let's merge!

00:18:12.208 --> 00:18:14.708
The enemy is headed this way!

00:18:14.708 --> 00:18:16.750
That movement by Abductors...

00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:19.375
I sense their purpose is something
other than attacking us.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:26.875
They hacked into our communication circuit!

00:18:26.875 --> 00:18:28.292
What?!

00:18:28.292 --> 00:18:30.708
Hello to those on Vega.

00:18:30.708 --> 00:18:35.833
I'm Izumo Kamurogi,
the supreme leader of Altair.

00:18:35.833 --> 00:18:38.833
I'd like to talk to your commander.

00:18:38.833 --> 00:18:41.000
The supreme leader?!

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:42.500
This guy is...

00:18:44.708 --> 00:18:49.000
I'm Crea Drosera. I'm the
commander at Neo-DEAVA.

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:53.833
Oh? So the commander is
an Igura... A woman, huh?

00:18:53.833 --> 00:18:57.708
I thought most women did not like fighting.

00:18:57.708 --> 00:18:59.833
Yes, you could say that.

00:18:59.833 --> 00:19:04.833
However, in some circumstances,
women are stronger.

00:19:04.833 --> 00:19:06.667
You might be right.

00:19:06.667 --> 00:19:11.625
We are in need of them,
the strongest Rare Iguras, for a reason.

00:19:13.292 --> 00:19:16.458
Strongest Rare Iguras...

00:19:17.458 --> 00:19:22.375
It's not my intention to harm your planet.

00:19:22.375 --> 00:19:26.917
As long as I can bring some
Rare Iguras to our world...

00:19:26.917 --> 00:19:29.167
We can't allow such a thing!

00:19:29.167 --> 00:19:30.417
Hold it.

00:19:30.417 --> 00:19:32.250
Director?!

00:19:32.250 --> 00:19:36.583
If it's possible to have a discussion with them...

00:19:36.583 --> 00:19:38.833
What would Fudo say if he was here?

00:19:40.375 --> 00:19:44.208
Zessica's Vector machine is...
headed towards the Abductors!

00:19:45.875 --> 00:19:49.667
If they want women, then I'll go!

00:19:49.667 --> 00:19:52.458
I can change things by going with them!

00:19:54.208 --> 00:19:55.792
That machine...

00:19:56.875 --> 00:19:58.750
Rare Igura detected...!

00:20:05.333 --> 00:20:09.000
Don't do it, Zessica!
Don't throw your life away!

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:12.292
You're just feeling desperation right now!

00:20:12.292 --> 00:20:14.458
No! I'm...

00:20:14.458 --> 00:20:18.417
You, the Rare Igura over there.
I see you want to surrender.

00:20:18.417 --> 00:20:19.958
We'll capture you.

00:20:21.583 --> 00:20:26.167
Atooi Gattai! Go! Aquarion!

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:30.708
Aquarion Evol!

00:20:33.417 --> 00:20:35.500
The flying Mechanical Angel?!

00:20:41.625 --> 00:20:45.750
This feeling... As I thought,
the one piloting it is...

00:20:46.792 --> 00:20:52.792
Why don't you take a good
look with your own eyes...?

00:21:01.833 --> 00:21:03.500
Mom...

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:05.625
Why is that illusion appearing?

00:21:08.625 --> 00:21:13.250
Someone is toying with
the strings of Amata's heart.

00:21:14.333 --> 00:21:16.000
Memories?

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.458
They are sweet... and bitter.

00:21:18.458 --> 00:21:22.250
Is this Mykage's doing?! How crafty!

00:21:22.250 --> 00:21:25.542
But the Mechanical Angel stopped moving.

00:21:25.542 --> 00:21:28.167
There's no doubt. That's...

00:21:29.167 --> 00:21:31.458
What on earth is going on?!

00:21:31.458 --> 00:21:33.375
Amata! Your enemy is right in front of you!

00:21:33.375 --> 00:21:34.875
Zessica!

00:21:35.958 --> 00:21:38.667
I'll never let Zessica go!

00:21:43.333 --> 00:21:45.500
Don't be rash, Zessica!

00:21:52.333 --> 00:21:54.625
--Mix!
--Mix!

00:21:54.625 --> 00:21:56.167
Mix!

00:22:01.208 --> 00:22:05.750
I won't let you get away! Mugen Punch!

00:22:07.625 --> 00:22:11.875
Winged child... I have a
feeling we'll meet again.

00:22:20.917 --> 00:22:24.542
Oh, no... She was taken in my place.

00:22:24.542 --> 00:22:25.542
Mix...

00:22:25.542 --> 00:22:27.042
Mix!

00:22:45.583 --> 00:22:48.875
Mix!

00:22:59.292 --> 00:23:07.208
<i>Kimi e tsuzuku sakamichi ni</i>
<i>shiroi hana ga saiteta</i>

00:23:07.208 --> 00:23:14.833
<i>Yume kara sameta ato mo kanashii sora miteta</i>

00:23:19.417 --> 00:23:25.208
<i>Kono kimochi happa no ura ni sunderu</i>

00:23:26.833 --> 00:23:34.667
<i>Asatsuyu ga ochiru oto ni mimi o sumaseteru no</i>

00:23:34.667 --> 00:23:42.458
<i>Kami sama anata ga tsukutta</i>
<i>sekai wa kanpeki ja nai</i>

00:23:42.458 --> 00:23:50.250
<i>Koko de wa mainichi koi ga</i>
<i>poroporo shinde yuku</i>

00:23:50.250 --> 00:23:54.083
<i>Hajimete suki ni natta no</i>

00:23:54.083 --> 00:23:57.375
<i>Anata wa shiranai desho</i>

00:23:57.375 --> 00:24:01.833
<i>Chikyuu no uragawa de ii kara</i>

00:24:01.833 --> 00:24:05.042
<i>Soba ni ite hoshikatta</i>

00:24:05.042 --> 00:24:09.542
<i>Watashi o wasurete mo ii kara</i>

00:24:09.542 --> 00:24:15.625
<i>Soba ni ite hoshikatta</i>

00:24:19.167 --> 00:24:21.667
I hated myself for being timid.

00:24:21.667 --> 00:24:23.833
But I feel that precisely because I'm afraid,

00:24:23.833 --> 00:24:26.500
I can move forward without hesitation.

00:24:26.500 --> 00:24:31.042
It's my duty to step forward right now.

00:24:31.042 --> 00:24:33.417
"Next Episode 'First Reunion'"
Next time! "First Reunion."
